        "text": "=:speech_balloon: *New IG comment lead*\n\n*From:* {{ $('Match Keyword').item.json.commenter || 'unknown' }}\n*Comment:* {{ $('Match Keyword').item.json.comment }}\n*Keyword:* {{ $('Match Keyword').item.json.keyword }} → {{ $('Match Keyword').item.json.leadMagnet }}\n*Post:* {{ $('Match Keyword').item.json.postRef || '—' }}\n*GHL:* <{{ $('Match Keyword').item.json.contactUrl }}|open contact>\n\nDM handed to GHL, verifying delivery in 90s…",
